  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Duckbutt Barbers Journal Overview Book a chair Menu Book a chair Prices Barbers Looks Memberships Journal The shop About Gift cards Careers FAQ Contact Visit Laugavegur 42 101 Reykjav\u00edk Tuesday to Friday, 10 to 19 Saturday, 10 to 17 Look of the week Skin fade \u00a9 2026 Duckbutt Terms Privacy Cookies About A barbershop on Laugavegur, since 2019. Duckbutt opened in a room that used to sell wool. One chair, a borrowed mirror and a notebook of regulars who followed Einar from his old shop. Six years on there are four chairs, and the notebook is a lot thicker. How it started Einar wanted a shop where nobody rushes you out of the chair. No screens, no loud music, and a barber who remembers how you like the back. Six years later the room is bigger, but the idea has not changed. 2019 Opened on Laugavegur with one chair 2020 Sigr\u00fan joins and a second chair goes in 2022 We take the room next door, four chairs 2024 Memberships for the regulars How we work 01 We take our time Every booking gets the full slot. If a cut needs ten more minutes, it gets them. 02 We tell you the truth If a style will not suit your hair or your mornings, we say so before we start. 03 We keep it simple G",
